# Core — Regkasse

Modular rules live under `.cursor/rules/`. This file is the always-applied slice. Domain detail is in the numbered `.mdc` files. `AGENTS.md` is the index.

## Purpose
This repository is a POS monorepo. Prefer safe, incremental improvements over broad rewrites. Follow real package boundaries, preserve current architecture unless explicitly asked otherwise, and make the smallest safe change that satisfies the task.

## Cursor / AI Agent Integration
- Cursor loads **`.cursor/rules/000-core.mdc`** on every task (`alwaysApply: true`). Domain rules attach by glob. Workflow and deploy rules are manual (no globs).
- **`AGENTS.md`** stays at the repo root as the GitHub-visible index. Do **not** delete it and do **not** paste the full rule set back into it.
- **`.cursorrules`** is a **redirect + project index** only. Do **not** duplicate full rules there — update the matching file under `.cursor/rules/` and keep the `AGENTS.md` index in sync.
- For medium or large tasks, also read **`REGKASSE_AI_ONBOARDING.md`**, optionally **`docs/PROJECT_COMPREHENSIVE_DOCUMENTATION.md`**, and relevant docs under `ai/`.
- Keep rule files valid Markdown (closed code fences, proper headings); broken formatting reduces what agents can parse reliably.

**Last updated:** 2026-10-27

